stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> VALIDATE: Schema + Topology + SHA
    VALIDATE --> PREFLIGHT: Valid
    VALIDATE --> [*]: Invalid (exit 1)
    PREFLIGHT --> SCHEDULE: Record start SHA
    SCHEDULE --> READ_BATCH: Ready parallel_reads
    SCHEDULE --> SINGLE_NODE: Ready gate / barrier / mutation
    READ_BATCH --> BATCH_CHECK: Pool drained
    BATCH_CHECK --> SCHEDULE: Porcelain + HEAD unchanged
    SINGLE_NODE --> COMMIT: Mutation in bounds
    COMMIT --> SCHEDULE: Committed or no-op
    SINGLE_NODE --> SCHEDULE: Gate / barrier exit 0
    SINGLE_NODE --> FALLBACK: Retries exhausted
    FALLBACK --> SCHEDULE: Substituted
    FALLBACK --> HALT: Fallback failed
    BATCH_CHECK --> HALT: Changed
    SCHEDULE --> SUCCESS: No nodes remaining
    HALT --> [*]: Rollback (worktree) or halt (no-workspace)
    SUCCESS --> [*]
